{"id":"vlevo","lemma":"влево","pos":"adv","rank":3312,"glosses":["to the left"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/69/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Поверни ключ влево.","en":"Turn the key to the left.","words":[{"g":"to turn, to swing","l":"повернуть"},{"g":"key"},null]},{"text":"Там дорога поворачивает влево.","en":"The road turns left there.","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"road"},null,null]},{"text":"Он резко повернул влево.","en":"He made a sharp turn to the left.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"sharply"},{"g":"to turn, to swing","l":"повернуть"},null]},{"text":"Он сделал резкий поворот влево.","en":"He made a sharp turn to the left.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"sharp, keen"},{"g":"turn"},null]},{"text":"Башня слегка наклонилась влево.","en":"The tower leaned slightly to the left.","words":[{"g":"tower"},{"g":"lightly, slightly"},null,null]}]}